+//! Exercises the public codec surface (`encode_header`/`parse_header`,
+//! `encode_mutation`/`parse_mutation`, `metadata_from_header`) against the
+//! rust wire shapes. Run against `rpi_harness::session::jsonl::*` only — no FS.
